<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ZEKRA — Our Memories</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
    --bg:#10070c;
    --bg2:#1d0d15;
    --card:#25121b;
    --card2:#301722;
    --pink:#e19ab2;
    --pink2:#f2c5d3;
    --gold:#d9b477;
    --white:#fff8fb;
    --muted:#bca7af;
    --line:rgba(255,255,255,.09);
}
* {
    box-sizing:border-box;
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
}
html {
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
}
body {
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 10%,rgba(225,154,178,.12),transparent 28%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 50%,rgba(217,180,119,.08),transparent 25%),
        var(--bg);
    color:var(--white);
    font-family:"DM Sans",sans-serif;
    overflow-x:hidden;
}
/* ---------------- PASSWORD ---------------- */
#passwordScreen {
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    z-index:99999;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    padding:22px;
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%,rgba(225,154,178,.14),transparent 38%),
        #0c0509;
}
.password-box {
    width:100%;
    max-width:410px;
    padding:48px 28px;
    text-align:center;
    border:1px solid rgba(217,180,119,.22);
    border-radius:30px;
    background:rgba(35,16,25,.72);
    backdrop-filter:blur(25px);
    box-shadow:0 30px 100px rgba(0,0,0,.55);
    animation:boxIn 1s ease;
}
@keyframes boxIn {
    from {
        opacity:0;
        transform:scale(.92) translateY(20px);
    }
    to {
        opacity:1;
        transform:scale(1) translateY(0);
    }
}
.logo {
    font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;
    font-size:48px;
    letter-spacing:7px;
    color:var(--pink2);
}
.password-small {
    color:var(--gold);
    letter-spacing:4px;
    font-size:10px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin:8px 0 35px;
}
.password-box h2 {
    font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;
    font-size:32px;
    font-weight:500;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}
.password-box p {
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:13px;
    line-height:1.7;
    margin-bottom:25px;
}
.password-box input {
    width:100%;
    padding:16px;
    border-radius:16px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    outline:none;
    font-size:15px;
    margin-bottom:12px;
}
.password-box button {
    width:100%;
    padding:16px;
    border:0;
    border-radius:16px;
    cursor:pointer;
    color:white;
    font-weight:600;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#df91aa,#b96685);
    box-shadow:0 12px 35px rgba(190,95,130,.22);
    transition:.3s;
}
.password-box button:hover {
    transform:translateY(-2px);
}
#error {
    display:none;
    color:#ed9daf;
    font-size:12px;
    margin-top:13px;
}
/* ---------------- WEBSITE ---------------- */
#website {
    display:none;
}
section {
    width:min(1050px,92%);
    margin:auto;
}
/* ---------------- MUSIC BUTTON ---------------- */
.music-btn {
    position:fixed;
    right:20px;
    bottom:20px;
    z-index:9000;
    width:58px;
    height:58px;
    border-radius:50%;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
    background:rgba(38,17,27,.78);
    backdrop-filter:blur(15px);
    color:white;
    cursor:pointer;
    box-shadow:0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    font-size:21px;
    transition:.35s;
}
.music-btn:hover {
    transform:scale(1.08);
}
.music-btn.playing {
    animation:pulseMusic 1.6s infinite;
}
@keyframes pulseMusic {
    0%,100% {
        box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(225,154,178,.25);
    }
    50% {
        box-shadow:0 0 0 13px rgba(225,154,178,0);
    }
}
/* ---------------- HERO ---------------- */
.hero {
    min-height:92vh;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    text-align:center;
    position:relative;
}
.hero-content {
    max-width:720px;
}
.eyebrow {
    color:var(--gold);
    font-size:10px;
    letter-spacing:5px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}
.hero h1 {
    font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;
    font-size:clamp(65px,12vw,125px);
    font-weight:500;
    line-height:.82;
    margin-bottom:30px;
}
.hero h1 span {
    color:var(--pink);
    font-style:italic;
}
.hero p {
    max-width:520px;
    margin:auto;
    color:var(--muted);
    line-height:1.9;
    font-size:14px;
}
.scroll {
    position:absolute;
    bottom:30px;
    left:50%;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    color:#8e737d;
    font-size:10px;
    letter-spacing:3px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    animation:float 2s infinite;
}
@keyframes float {
    0%,100% {transform:translate(-50%,0);}
    50% {transform:translate(-50%,7px);}
}
/* ---------------- COUNTER ---------------- */
.counter-section {
    text-align:center;
    padding:80px 0 130px;
}
.counter-label {
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:2px;
}
.counter {
    font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;
    font-size:clamp(70px,15vw,140px);
    line-height:1;
    color:var(--pink2);
    margin:10px 0;
}
.counter-sub {
    color:var(--gold);
    letter-spacing:4px;
    font-size:10px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
}
/* ---------------- HEADINGS ---------------- */
.section-heading {
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:45px;
}
.section-heading small {
    color:var(--gold);
    font-size:10px;
    letter-spacing:4px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
}
.section-heading h2 {
    font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;
    font-size:50px;
    font-weight:500;
    margin-top:10px;
}
/* ---------------- MEMORY GRID ---------------- */
.memories {
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    gap:20px;
}
.memory {
    position:relative;
    height:470px;
    overflow:hidden;
    border-radius:26px;
    background:var(--card);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    cursor:pointer;
    box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
    transition:.5s;
}
.memory:hover {
    transform:translateY(-7px);
    border-color:rgba(225,154,178,.25);
}
.memory img {
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    object-fit:cover;
    transition:transform .8s ease;
}
.memory:hover img {
    transform:scale(1.07);
}
.memory::after {
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    background:linear-gradient(
        to top,
        rgba(10,4,7,.88),
        rgba(10,4,7,.05) 65%
    );
}
.memory-info {
    position:absolute;
    z-index:2;
    bottom:25px;
    left:25px;
    right:25px;
}
.memory-number {
    color:var(--gold);
    font-size:10px;
    letter-spacing:3px;
    margin-bottom:7px;
}
.memory-info h3 {
    font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;
    font-size:34px;
    font-weight:500;
}
.memory-info p {
    color:#d1bec5;
    font-size:12px;
    margin-top:5px;
}
@media(max-width:650px) {
    .memories {
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }
    .memory {
        height:440px;
    }
}
/* ---------------- VIDEO ---------------- */
.video-section {
    padding:140px 0;
}
.video-box {
    overflow:hidden;
    border-radius:28px;
    border:1px solid rgba(217,180,119,.2);
    background:#080406;
    box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
}
.video-box video {
    display:block;
    width:100%;
    max-height:650px;
    object-fit:cover;
}
/* ---------------- NOTE ---------------- */
.note-section {
    padding:80px 0 150px;
}
.note-card {
    max-width:700px;
    margin:auto;
    text-align:center;
    padding:65px 30px;
    border-radius:30px;
    background:
        linear-gradient(
            145deg,
            rgba(225,154,178,.10),
            rgba(217,180,119,.04)
        );
    border:1px solid rgba(217,180,119,.2);
    box-shadow:0 25px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
}
.note-icon {
    font-size:27px;
    margin-bottom:18px;
}
.note-card h2 {
    font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;
    font-size:45px;
    font-weight:500;
}
.note-card p {
    color:var(--muted);
    line-height:2;
    margin-top:20px;
}
/* ---------------- MODAL ---------------- */
.modal {
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    z-index:10000;
    display:none;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    padding:20px;
    background:rgba(5,2,4,.86);
    backdrop-filter:blur(15px);
}
.modal.active {
    display:flex;
    animation:modalFade .35s ease;
}
@keyframes modalFade {
    from {opacity:0;}
    to {opacity:1;}
}
.modal-content {
    width:min(900px,100%);
    max-height:92vh;
    overflow:auto;
    border-radius:30px;
    background:linear-gradient(145deg,#2b141f,#170b11);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
    box-shadow:0 40px 120px rgba(0,0,0,.65);
    animation:modalIn .45s ease;
    position:relative;
}
@keyframes modalIn {
    from {
        opacity:0;
        transform:translateY(30px) scale(.97);
    }
    to {
        opacity:1;
        transform:translateY(0) scale(1);
    }
}
.close {
    position:absolute;
    top:15px;
    right:15px;
    z-index:5;
    width:40px;
    height:40px;
    border-radius:50%;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
    background:rgba(0,0,0,.35);
    color:white;
    cursor:pointer;
    font-size:18px;
}
.main-memory-image {
    width:100%;
    max-height:520px;
    object-fit:cover;
    display:block;
}
.memory-story {
    padding:35px 30px 45px;
}
.memory-date {
    color:var(--gold);
    font-size:10px;
    letter-spacing:3px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
}
.memory-story h2 {
    font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;
    font-size:46px;
    font-weight:500;
    margin:8px 0 15px;
}
.memory-story p {
    color:var(--muted);
    line-height:2;
    font-size:14px;
}
.extra-title {
    font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;
    font-size:29px;
    margin:35px 0 15px;
}
.extra-images {
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:10px;
}
.extra-images img {
    width:100%;
    aspect-ratio:1;
    object-fit:cover;
    border-radius:14px;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:.3s;
}
.extra-images img:hover {
    transform:scale(1.03);
}
@media(max-width:600px) {
    .extra-images {
        grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    }
    .memory-story h2 {
        font-size:38px;
    }
}
/* ---------------- FOOTER ---------------- */
footer {
    text-align:center;
    padding:35px 20px 50px;
    color:#715b64;
    font-size:10px;
    letter-spacing:2px;
}
footer span {
    color:var(--pink);
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<!-- ================= PASSWORD ================= -->
<div id="passwordScreen">
    <div class="password-box">
        <div class="logo">ZEKRA</div>
        <div class="password-small">
            Our memories
        </div>
        <h2>Welcome to our little world</h2>
        <p>
            A place made only for the moments<br>
            we never want to forget.
        </p>
        <input
            type="password"
            id="password"
            placeholder="Enter password"
            onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter') checkPassword()"
        >
        <button onclick="checkPassword()">
            Open our memories
        </button>
        <div id="error">
            Wrong password. Try again.
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<!-- ================= WEBSITE ================= -->
<div id="website">
    <!-- MUSIC -->
    <audio id="music" loop>
        <source src="song.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
    </audio>
    <button class="music-btn" id="musicBtn" onclick="toggleMusic()">
        ♫
    </button>
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="eyebrow">
                Two hearts · One story
            </div>
            <h1>
                Our <span>little</span><br>
                forever.
            </h1>
            <p>
                Every picture holds a moment.
                Every moment holds a feeling.
                And somehow, all of them became our story.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="scroll">
            Scroll to remember ↓
        </div>
    </section>
    <!-- COUNTER -->
    <section class="counter-section">
        <div class="counter-label">
            We've been writing our story for
        </div>
        <div class="counter" id="counter">
            0000
        </div>
        <div class="counter-sub">
            Beautiful days together
        </div>
    </section>
    <!-- MEMORIES -->
    <section>
        <div class="section-heading">
            <small>
                Our memories
            </small>
            <h2>
                Little moments.
            </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="memories">
            <!-- MEMORY 1 -->
            <div class="memory" onclick="openMemory(0)">
                <img src="memory1.jpg">
                <div class="memory-info">
                    <div class="memory-number">
                        MEMORY 01
                    </div>
                    <h3>
                        The beginning
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        The moment everything started.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- MEMORY 2 -->
            <div class="memory" onclick="openMemory(1)">
                <img src="memory2.jpg">
                <div class="memory-info">
                    <div class="memory-number">
                        MEMORY 02
                    </div>
                    <h3>
                        That day
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        A day worth remembering.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- MEMORY 3 -->
            <div class="memory" onclick="openMemory(2)">
                <img src="memory3.jpg">
                <div class="memory-info">
                    <div class="memory-number">
                        MEMORY 03
                    </div>
                    <h3>
                        Just us
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Nothing else mattered.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- MEMORY 4 -->
            <div class="memory" onclick="openMemory(3)">
                <img src="memory4.jpg">
                <div class="memory-info">
                    <div class="memory-number">
                        MEMORY 04
                    </div>
                    <h3>
                        A beautiful day
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        One of those days we keep talking about.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- MEMORY 5 -->
            <div class="memory" onclick="openMemory(4)">
                <img src="memory5.jpg">
                <div class="memory-info">
                    <div class="memory-number">
                        MEMORY 05
                    </div>
                    <h3>
                        With you
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Ordinary moments became special.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- MEMORY 6 -->
            <div class="memory" onclick="openMemory(5)">
                <img src="memory6.jpg">
                <div class="memory-info">
                    <div class="memory-number">
                        MEMORY 06
                    </div>
                    <h3>
                        One more memory
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Another page in our story.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- MEMORY 7 -->
            <div class="memory" onclick="openMemory(6)">
                <img src="memory7.jpg">
                <div class="memory-info">
                    <div class="memory-number">
                        MEMORY 07
                    </div>
                    <h3>
                        Our favorite
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        A moment we wish could last forever.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- MEMORY 8 -->
            <div class="memory" onclick="openMemory(7)">
                <img src="memory8.jpg">
                <div class="memory-info">
                    <div class="memory-number">
                        MEMORY 08
                    </div>
                    <h3>
                        Together
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Just another reason to smile.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- MEMORY 9 -->
            <div class="memory" onclick="openMemory(8)">
                <img src="memory9.jpg">
                <div class="memory-info">
                    <div class="memory-number">
                        MEMORY 09
                    </div>
                    <h3>
                        This feeling
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Some things don't need an explanation.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- MEMORY 10 -->
            <div class="memory" onclick="openMemory(9)">
                <img src="memory10.jpg">
                <div class="memory-info">
                    <div class="memory-number">
                        MEMORY 10
                    </div>
                    <h3>
                        To be continued...
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Because our story isn't over.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <!-- VIDEO -->
    <section class="video-section">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <small>
                One moment in motion
            </small>
            <h2>
                Our little movie.
            </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="video-box">
            <video controls playsinline poster="video-cover.jpg">
                <source src="video.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                Your browser does not support video.
            </video>
        </div>
    </section>
    <!-- HIDDEN NOTE -->
    <section class="note-section">
        <div class="note-card">
            <div class="note-icon">
                ♡
            </div>
            <h2>
                A little note for you
            </h2>
            <p>
                If I could keep only one thing from all these memories,
                I wouldn't choose a picture, a place, or a day.
                I would choose the feeling of being with you.
                <br><br>
                And if this is only the beginning,
                I can't wait to see everything we'll remember next.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <footer>
        Made with love by <span>ZEKRA</span>
    </footer>
</div>
<!-- ================= MEMORY MODAL ================= -->
<div class="modal" id="memoryModal">
    <div class="modal-content">
        <button class="close" onclick="closeMemory()">
            ×
        </button>
        <img
            id="modalMainImage"
            class="main-memory-image"
            src=""
        >
        <div class="memory-story">
            <div class="memory-date" id="modalDate">
                OUR MEMORY
            </div>
            <h2 id="modalTitle">
                The beginning
            </h2>
            <p id="modalText">
                This was one of those moments we wish we could live again.
            </p>
            <div class="extra-title">
                More from this day
            </div>
            <div class="extra-images" id="extraImages"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<script>
/* ================= PASSWORD ================= */
const PASSWORD = "1234";
function checkPassword() {
    const input = document.getElementById("password").value;
    const error = document.getElementById("error");
    if(input === PASSWORD) {
        document.getElementById("passwordScreen").style.display = "none";
        document.getElementById("website").style.display = "block";
        document.body.style.overflow = "auto";
        startCounter();
        /*
        محاولة تشغيل الأغنية تلقائياً.
        بعض المتصفحات تمنع التشغيل التلقائي،
        لذلك يوجد زر الموسيقى أيضاً.
        */
        const music = document.getElementById("music");
        music.play()
        .then(() => {
            document.getElementById("musicBtn").classList.add("playing");
        })
        .catch(() => {});
    } else {
        error.style.display = "block";
    }
}
/* ================= MUSIC ================= */
const music = document.getElementById("music");
const musicBtn = document.getElementById("musicBtn");
function toggleMusic() {
    if(music.paused) {
        music.play();
        musicBtn.classList.add("playing");
    } else {
        music.pause();
        musicBtn.classList.remove("playing");
    }
}
/* ================= COUNTER ================= */
/*
غير التاريخ هنا
مثال:
2025-09-30
*/
const startDate = new Date("2025-09-30T00:00:00");
function startCounter() {
    function updateCounter() {
        const now = new Date();
        const difference = now - startDate;
        const days = Math.floor(
            difference / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24)
        );
        document.getElementById("counter").textContent =
            String(days).padStart(4,"0");
    }
    updateCounter();
    setInterval(updateCounter,60000);
}
/* ================= MEMORIES DATA ================= */
/*
كل Memory لها:
main = الصورة الأساسية
title = اسم الذكرى
date = التاريخ
text = الكلام
extra = صور إضافية من نفس اليوم
*/
const memories = [
    {
        main:"memory1.jpg",
        title:"The beginning",
        date:"The day it all started",
        text:"Some beginnings are quiet. But somehow, they become the most important chapters of our lives.",
        extra:[
            "memory1-1.jpg",
            "memory1-2.jpg",
            "memory1-3.jpg"
        ]
    },
    {
        main:"memory2.jpg",
        title:"That day",
        date:"A day worth remembering",
        text:"We probably didn't know it at the time, but this would become one of the moments we'd always remember.",
        extra:[
            "memory2-1.jpg",
            "memory2-2.jpg",
            "memory2-3.jpg"
        ]
    },
    {
        main:"memory3.jpg",
        title:"Just us",
        date:"Nothing else mattered",
        text:"No perfect place. No perfect plan. Just us, and somehow that was enough.",
        extra:[
            "memory3-1.jpg",
            "memory3-2.jpg",
            "memory3-3.jpg"
        ]
    },
    {
        main:"memory4.jpg",
        title:"A beautiful day",
        date:"One of our favorites",
        text:"A simple day that somehow turned into a memory we never wanted to lose.",
        extra:[
            "memory4-1.jpg",
            "memory4-2.jpg",
            "memory4-3.jpg"
        ]
    },
    {
        main:"memory5.jpg",
        title:"With you",
        date:"A little moment",
        text:"The smallest moments can sometimes become the ones we remember the most.",
        extra:[
            "memory5-1.jpg",
            "memory5-2.jpg",
            "memory5-3.jpg"
        ]
    },
    {
        main:"memory6.jpg",
        title:"One more memory",
        date:"Another page",
        text:"Another picture. Another laugh. Another reason to be grateful for us.",
        extra:[
            "memory6-1.jpg",
            "memory6-2.jpg",
            "memory6-3.jpg"
        ]
    },
    {
        main:"memory7.jpg",
        title:"Our favorite",
        date:"A moment to keep",
        text:"If we could save feelings instead of pictures, this is one we'd save forever.",
        extra:[
            "memory7-1.jpg",
            "memory7-2.jpg",
            "memory7-3.jpg"
        ]
    },
    {
        main:"memory8.jpg",
        title:"Together",
        date:"Just another beautiful day",
        text:"Being together turned an ordinary moment into something worth keeping.",
        extra:[
            "memory8-1.jpg",
            "memory8-2.jpg",
            "memory8-3.jpg"
        ]
    },
    {
        main:"memory9.jpg",
        title:"This feeling",
